<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-McIntosh shares suspended.</title>
<headline>RTRS-McIntosh shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokerage firm McIntosh Securites Ltd on Tuesday requested that its shares be suspended from trading, pending an announcement.</p>
<p>The company has called an 11.00 a.m. (2400 GMT) news conference, and is widely expected to announce a friendly takeover by New York-based broker Merrill Lynch and Co Inc.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
